@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
title E03：running は tick をまたいで START を記憶する

binary "start" as S
binary "stop" as P
binary "running（前）" as R
binary "running' = pump" as N

@1
S is low
P is low
R is low
N is low

@2
S is high
N is high

@3
S is low
R is high

@4
S is high
P is high
N is low

@5
S is low
P is low
R is low

@6

highlight 2 to 3 : 自己保持オン
highlight 4 to 5 : 停止優先
@enduml
